  "description": "One day, a zombie virus, presumed to have originated in Seoul, spreads without any known cause, and the country is devastated in just a few days. Han Jun-sik, a hikikomori who dreamed of the end of the world, used the underground warehouse of the supermarket where he worked as a refuge...\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Toptoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/pigpen/?p_id=mycelebs1), [Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=5588&pid=webtoonguide), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/3331), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=smtd), MeToon",
